OL,3,GNEWSAManx space group urges election
OL,4,Acandidates to back treaty
OL,5,
OL,6,FCandidates standing in the Isle of
OL,7,FMan's general election have been sent
OL,8,Fletters asking them to back the island
OL,9,Fsigning up to an international space
OL,10,Ftreaty.
OL,12,FThe Manx chapter of the Mars Society
OL,13,Fwants the island to become a signatory
OL,14,Fto the Artemis Accords, the framework
OL,15,Ffor peaceful, transparent space
OL,16,Fexploration now backed by more than 70
OL,17,Fnations, including the UK as a founding
OL,18,Fmember.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,447,445,260,140,0,100
