OL,3,GNEWSAManx space group urges election
OL,4,Acandidates to back treaty
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe accords, launched by Nasa in 2020,
OL,7,Fare non-binding and require no
OL,8,Fparliamentary ratification, membership
OL,9,Ffee or financial contribution to sign.
OL,11,FChapter leader Stuart Mullan said it
OL,12,Fwas a "low-risk, high-visibility way"
OL,13,Ffor the island to show ambition around
OL,14,Fspace projects.
